From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Devin <devin@cognition.ai>
Date: Sun, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: drop the dead benchmark step from the release workflow

release.yml ran `npm run benchmark:all` — the script was deleted along
with the benchmark pipeline (it measured a removed SDK), so every tag
push fails at this step before the release is ever created.

---
diff --git a/.github/workflows/release.yml b/.github/workflows/release.yml
index 8d508d1..a952e54 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/release.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/release.yml
@@ -56,10 +56,6 @@ jobs:
           test -f docs/USAGE_GUIDE.md && echo "✓ USAGE_GUIDE.md exists"
           test -f docs/QUICK_START.md && echo "✓ QUICK_START.md exists"
 
-      - name: Run benchmark
-        run: |
-          npm run benchmark:all -- --iterations 100 --output benchmark-results.md --format markdown
-
       - name: Generate release notes
         id: release_notes
         run: |
